dsh-labview README · Development：`test/verify-223.mjs` compares the engine against reference output byte-for-byte;
`test/smoke.mjs` drives the three plugin tools end to end on a temp copy;
`test/harness-swap.mjs` temporarily points the vendored `defineTool`/`Schema`
stubs at the real modules inside the installed harness and re-runs the smoke
test, which is what proves the Host accepts the parameter specs, output schemas
and config schema. It restores the stubs afterwards, even on failure.
